Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same car, same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,hit from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:02.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Only the headrest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:03.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.47,0:00:04.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,The car behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:04.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,shoves your car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:05.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,forward, and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:05.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,seat shoves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:06.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:06.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,But your head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:07.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,is heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:08.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,For a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,it stays behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:09.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,So your neck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,bends backward, faster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:11.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,than you could
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:12.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,ever react.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:13.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,With the headrest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:13.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,low, nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.91,0:00:14.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,stops it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,The head whips
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:15.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,back over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:15.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Almost sixty degrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:17.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,in about a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:18.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,tenth of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:18.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:19.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,That stretch strains
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,the muscles and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:21.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,ligaments in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:21.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:22.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's whiplash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:23.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,With the headrest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,up, the head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:24.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,moves less than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:25.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,two inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:26.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the headrest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,catches it, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:27.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,the neck stops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:28.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,under twenty degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:29.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:30.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,One neck bends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:31.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,three times further.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:32.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,So set it:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:33.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,the top of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:33.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,the headrest level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the top
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:34.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:35.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,And keep it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:36.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,close, a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:36.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,of inches behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:37.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,your head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:37.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:38.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Five seconds of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:39.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,adjusting, and your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:40.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,head gets caught
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:41.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of whipped.
